      "comment": "PREPARATION (2) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at this track over 350m (19.52). Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Has winning claims on her best figures. WINE LOVER (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2.75 lengths at this track in a handy 19.53 beating Fire Up Mark. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. CHOJI AKIMICHI (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4 length fifth (19.62) over 350m at this track. Bold showing expected. MISS CHARMED (5) placed last time at this track and distance - worth some thought.",
